e surface of the leather  this will protect the bag from  dye transfer from jeans uv damage and  liquid and oil staining  it's really important to protect your  leather bags for future wear and tear  i'm really happy how the restoration of  this bag turned out the interior is now  ready to be worn and the lining is all  fixed up the outside is no longer  showing any signs of wear and tear and  the gold hardware is looking nice and  shiny i think my customer is going to be  really pleased with the outcome  [Music]  you
 

